  "summary": "Studies applying transformer-based architectures, specifically Self-Attention Encoder Models, to road traffic forecasting include works by Chen et al. (2019), Duarte et al. (2020), Fischer et al. (2022), and El-Sayed et al. (2021) [V0221, V0222, V0224, V0223]. These models were evaluated on datasets including MetroFlow, Atlas-ICU, and LedgerGuard, reporting performance metrics such as accuracy, MAE, and F1 scores [V0221, V0222, V0224]. Additionally, El-Sayed et al. (2021) applied Self-Attention Encoder Models to AgriSat-4 [V0223]. For comparison, Haddad et al. (2024) applied Multilevel Probabilistic Models to the same task [V0235].",
